{"data": {"id": "JHN.3.16-JHN.3.18", "orgId": "JHN.3.16-JHN.3.18", "bibleId": "7ea794434e9ea7ee-01", "bookId": "JHN", "chapterIds": ["JHN.3"], "reference": "约翰福音 3:16-18", "content": [{"name": "para", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"style": "p"}, "items": [{"name": "verse-span", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"class": "verse-span", "verseId": "JHN.3.16", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.16"]}, "items": [{"name": "verse", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"number": "16", "style": "v", "sid": "JHN 3:16"}, "items": [{"text": "16", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"name": "verse-span", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"class": "verse-span", "verseId": "JHN.3.16", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.16"]}, "items": [{"text": "“因为上帝爱世人，甚至将祂独一的儿子赐给他们，叫一切信祂的人不致灭亡，反得永生。 ", "type": "text", "attrs": {"verseId": "JHN.3.16", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.16"]}}]}, {"name": "verse-span", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"class": "verse-span", "verseId": "JHN.3.17", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.17"]}, "items": [{"name": "verse", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"number": "17", "style": "v", "sid": "JHN 3:17"}, "items": [{"text": "17", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"name": "verse-span", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"class": "verse-span", "verseId": "JHN.3.17", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.17"]}, "items": [{"text": "上帝差祂的儿子到世上来，不是要定世人的罪，而是要借着祂的儿子拯救世人。 ", "type": "text", "attrs": {"verseId": "JHN.3.17", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.17"]}}]}, {"name": "verse-span", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"class": "verse-span", "verseId": "JHN.3.18", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.18"]}, "items": [{"name": "verse", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"number": "18", "style": "v", "sid": "JHN 3:18"}, "items": [{"text": "18", "type": "text"}]}]}, {"name": "verse-span", "type": "tag", "attrs": {"class": "verse-span", "verseId": "JHN.3.18", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.18"]}, "items": [{"text": "信祂的人不会被定罪，不信的人已经被定罪，因为他们不信上帝独一的儿子。 ", "type": "text", "attrs": {"verseId": "JHN.3.18", "verseOrgIds": ["JHN.3.18"]}}]}]}], "verseCount": 3, "copyright": "Biblica® 圣经当代译本™开放资源 版权所有©1979, 2005, 2007, 2011, 2022 Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Chinese Contemporary Bible™ (Simplified Script) Copyright © 1979, 2005, 2007, 2011, 2022 by Biblica, Inc. “Biblica”是国际圣经协会在美国专利和商标局注册的商标。获得授权使用。 “Biblica” is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission."}, "meta": {}}